.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_CIPHER-SM4 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_CIPHER-SM4
.Nd The SM4 EVP_CIPHER implementations
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Support for SM4 symmetric encryption using the
.Sy EVP_CIPHER
API.
.Ss Algorithm Names
The following algorithms are available in the default provider:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqSM4-CBC:SM4"
.It \(dqSM4-ECB"
.It \(dqSM4-CTR"
.It \(dqSM4-OFB" or \(dqSM4-OFB128"
.It \(dqSM4-CFB" or \(dqSM4-CFB128"
.It \(dqSM4-GCM"
.It \(dqSM4-CCM"
.It \(dqSM4-XTS"
.El
.Ss Parameters
This implementation supports the parameters described in
.Xr EVP_EncryptInit 3 .
.Sh NOTES
The SM4-XTS implementation allows streaming to be performed, but each
.Xr EVP_EncryptUpdate 3
or
.Xr EVP_DecryptUpdate 3
call requires each input to be a multiple of the blocksize.
Only the final
.Xr EVP_EncryptUpdate 3
or
.Xr EVP_DecryptUpdate 3
call can optionally have an input that is not a multiple of the
blocksize but is larger than one block.
In that case ciphertext stealing (CTS) is used to fill the block.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr provider-cipher 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-default 7
